we need more time There are several reasons for this decision. We have had fewer Spanish-speaking collaborators than the project needs, and personal circumstances have slowed progress on the story. We also want to take the time required to revie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T10:57:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041672","verified_at":"2026-10-25T15:15:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707800-1846018067929134","game_id":"steam-4707800","kind":"update","title":"AmaTisMo - Demo 2.0 Update","summary":"AmaTisMo - Demo 2.0NewNew Chapter 3: A Step Outside.New backgrounds and artwork.New scene and emotion descriptions.New accessibility option to enable or disable emotion descriptions.New option to adjust narration speed.New character themes for Amatista and Paula.New sound effects and ambient sounds.FixesFixed several issues affecting saving and loading.Fixed an issue that could prevent music from playing correctly after loading a save.Fixed screen reader language synchronization.Fixed several is","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T10:24:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929134","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707800-1844751498222069","game_id":"steam-4707800","kind":"update","title":"September Development Update: New WIP Art and Demo News","summary":"We are back with a short development update for AmaTisMo. As we mentioned in our latest news posts, we want to keep sharing progress on the game every month, even when the update is small. This time, we are showing two new work-in-progress environments and talking about the next demo update, which will include Chapter 3. Game progress We are still working on AmaTisMo's environments. The images we are sharing today are still works in progress: details are missing, colour, composition or polish ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T16:23:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222069","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707800-1841579228672245","game_id":"steam-4707800","kind":"update","title":"August Development Update: New WIP Art and Demo News","summary":"We are back with a short development update for AmaTisMo. As we mentioned in our latest news posts, we want to keep sharing progress on the game every month, even when the update is small. This time, we are showing new work-in-progress images and talking a little about the demo, which is now available to download on Steam. Game progress We are still working on AmaTisMo's environments and characters. The images we are sharing today are still works in progress: details are missing, colour, composi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T21:08:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672245","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707800-1839041357023150","game_id":"steam-4707800","kind":"update","title":"July Development Update: WIP Art and Steam Demo","summary":"We are back with a short development update for AmaTisMo. As we mentioned in our latest news posts, we want to keep sharing progress on the game every month, even when the update is small. The demo is now very close, so we would rather let many things be discovered directly by playing it. Still, we wanted to share two new work-in-progress environments before August arrives. Progress on the game's art We are still working on the art for AmaTisMo. The images we are sharing today are works in progr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T06:05:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357023150","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4707800-1835871199310787","game_id":"steam-4707800","kind":"update","title":"Development Update: Unity Testing, WIP Art and August Demo","summary":"It has been a month since our last update and, as promised, we are back to share what we have been working on and what comes next for AmaTisMo. Unity testing has begun We have started testing the new version of the game built in Unity. At the same time, we are continuing to develop the story for the upcoming chapters and working on the game's art. The images we are sharing today are still works in progress: details are still missing, and they may change before the final game. On the way to the u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T11:18:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310787","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:19:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4707800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4707800":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4707800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z"},"5046330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:39:21Z"}},"cont